 out with skeletons\, creepy critters\, fall décor\, and spooky surprises 
 around every turn. Fun for all ages!\nWatch out—spooky characters may be
  roaming the course!\nFriday & Saturday nights\nOctober 2&3\, 9&10\, 16&17
  2026\n7:00–11:00 PM\nA frightfully fun fundraiser supporting local stud
 ent groups!\nAdmission is $16\, with proceeds donated to participating gro
 ups.\nGather your bravest crew and come if you dare… Decor is up during 
 the day for a fun twist on fall miniature golf play for all ages.\n6040 St
 ate Route 96A\, Romulus — inside Sampson State Park\nwww.SenecaLakeResor
 ts.com\n#HauntedPuttAndPlay #HauntedMiniGolf #SenecaLakeResorts #SampsonSt
 atePark #FamilyFun #Fundraiser #School #waterloocentralschooldistrict #sou
 thsenecacentralschooldistrict @PathwayHomeoftheFingerLakes #PathwayHome #S
 enecaFallsCentralSchoolDistrict #RomulusFFA\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https
 ://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78486420/20261009190000
