BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Steve Gonsalves Live: A Life With Ghosts @ Hangar Theatre
DTSTART:20261010T223000Z
DTEND:20261011T004500Z
DTSTAMP:20261010T152037Z
UID:82d1f21c3aa944c13a91fd87a6da0f010b49ae0b@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:Steve Gonsalves Live: A Life With Ghosts\nSaturday\, October 1
 0 @ 6:30 pm\nA Life with Ghosts returns this fall with Steve Gonsalves for
  an immersive evening of hauntings\, history\, and true tales from his rev
 ealing archive.\nKnown for Ghost Hunters\, Ghost Nation\, The House Inbetw
 een\, and as the bestselling author of A Life with Ghosts\, Steve shares s
 tories from some of his favorite and most well-known cases. This updated s
 how features new stories\, historical details and exclusive footage.\nThro
 ugh firsthand accounts\, rare clips\, haunted objects\, and behind-the-sce
 nes moments\, Steve gives audiences a close look at the cases\, evidence\,
  and experiences from his years of investigations. Along the way\, he expl
 ores the real history behind these cases — history that is sometimes jus
 t as unsettling as the hauntings themselves.\nThe evening also includes hu
 mor\, audience interaction\, and a live Q&A\, giving fans the chance to as
 k Steve about ghost hunting\, evidence\, and the stories behind the invest
 igations.\nA Life with Ghosts is a personal and thought-provoking night wi
 th one of the most recognized voices in the paranormal.\nVIP Ticket Includ
 es:\nEarly Entry and First Pick of Seating in Front Row Areas\nCollectors 
 Hard Laminate Badge and Lanyard\nSigned Poster\nSigned Copy of Steve’s B
 ook “A Life With Ghosts”\nPhoto Op with Steve\nSCHEDULE:\n5:00pm – E
 arly Entry for VIP Ticket Holders to Meet Steve Gonsalves\n6:30pm – Door
 s Open for Ticket Holders\n7:00pm – Event begins (show lasts approximate
 ly 1 hour 45 min)\nNOTE: Ghost Hunt Weekends\, not the Hangar Theatre Box 
 Office\, is handling ticketing for this event\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - htt
 ps://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78466319/20261010183000
GEO:42.457531;-76.515267
LOCATION:Hangar Theatre\, 801 Taughannock Boulevard\, Ithaca\, New York\, 
 14850\, United States
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78466319/20261010183000
END:VEVENT
