DESCRIPTION:Event by Elmira Downtown Development\, Inc\n717 Dickinson St\,
  Elmira\, NY\nDuration: 2 hr\nPublic\nSeeking Groups & Individuals for our
  annual Elmira Downtown Holiday Parade! Many costumes to choose from or co
 me with your own idea! Come early for the best selection of costumes!\nWe
 ’ve got over 300 costumes ready and waiting for volunteers! Several floa
 ts that groups or families can sponsor!\nWant to be part of this beloved E
 lmira tradition that’s been bringing holiday cheer since 1956? Now is yo
 ur chance to help us create the magic and bring smiles to the kiddos linin
 g the streets.\nIf you’re interested in volunteering in this year’s pa
 rade\, or have any general questions\, stop by the fitting to find your co
 stume and learn more.\nLocation: The Pole Barn\, 717 Dickinson St. Elmira 
 NY\n(Directions: Turn off Clemens onto 5th St\, then take the second left 
 onto Dickinson St.)\n- October 7th 5:30pm-7:30pm\n-October 18th from 8:30a
 m-9:00am\nThe Downtown Elmira 70th Annual Holiday Parade\, sponsored by Co
 mmunity Bank\, N.A. and steps off the Friday after Thanksgiving at 10am! S
 ee you there!\nCan't make it but want to be involved? More costume fitting
