 nd chief bottle washer. Is Andy G. Twanger his real name...well maybe (or 
 not) but it sure sounds good. Mr. Twanger's love of music started at his f
 irst concert when he saw the Beatles live at New York's Shea Stadium. Was 
 it the music or was it the girls going crazy no one really knows for sure
 \, but from that day forward all hell broke loose when A.G. Twanger traded
  his 10 speed bike to buy his first electric bass guitar.\n\nSource: FLXca
